{
    "title": "Truth or Dare - Spicy and Evil",
    "description": "Get ready for the most exciting truth or dare experience ever! \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a fun-filled party game to break the ice, a way to bond with your friends, or a spicy spin the bottle game to turn up the heat, this group game has everything you need for a wild time. \u2028\u2028Perfect for groups, couples, and anyone ready for a daring adventure, our truth or dare game guarantees endless fun and laughter!\r\n\r\nWith +1300 unique truth or dare challenges, you can dive into a range of categories designed to suit any mood or occasion. Start light with \"Party Starter\" or \"Family Night\", perfect for keeping things friendly and fun. Want something a little crazier? Check out \"Insane Party\" or spice things up with more daring packs like \"Couple\"s, \"Spice It Up\", \"Dirty & Wild\", and much more.\r\n\r\nWhether you're playing with your closest friends or that special someone, there\u2019s always a spin the bottle challenge that will push the boundaries and create unforgettable memories.\r\n\r\nThese are just some of the categories you\u2019ll find:\r\n\u25c6 Party Starter\r\n\u25c6 Spice It Up\r\n\u25c6 Couples\r\n\u25c6 Dirty & Wild\r\n\u25c6 Insane Party\r\n\r\nNot in the mood for a pre-set category? No problem! You can customize your own challenges, making this the ultimate party game that adapts to your vibe. Use it for a casual night in, as a hilarious group game for gatherings, or as a wild spin the bottle party game to keep the energy going. The best part? You can play at random, just like the classic spin the bottle, or take turns\u2014it's up to you how you keep the fun flowing!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u25c6 Thousands of truth or dare challenges to keep you entertained for hours\r\n\u25c6 Multiple party game categories tailored to every type of group, mood, or event\r\n\u25c6 Perfect for a classic spin the bottle game with friends, or a fun way to bond with your partner\r\n\u25c6 Customizable truths and dares\u2014create your own challenges for a truly unique party game experience\r\n\u25c6 Take turns or play randomly for a spin the bottle truth or dare game that\u2019s different every time you play\r\n\u25c6 Special categories for those looking to push things a little further\r\n\r\nWhether you're hosting a game night, hanging out with friends, or looking for an exciting date night idea, this party game is your go-to for unforgettable moments. Challenge yourself, discover more about your friends, or get closer to your partner\u2014the possibilities are endless! This is the group game and truth or dare experience that takes any event to the next level.\r\n\r\nDownload and make every night an adventure with the ultimate truth or dare party game! Fun, laughter, and wild memories are just a tap away.\r\n\r\n===============\r\n\r\nAny questions or suggestions? \r\n\r\nReach us at truthordare@cosmicode.pt\r\n\r\n===============\r\n\r\nTerms Of Use: https://cosmicode.games/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready for the most exciting truth or dare experience ever! <br><br>Whether you&#39;re looking for a fun-filled party game to break the ice, a way to bond with your friends, or a spicy spin the bottle game to turn up the heat, this group game has everything you need for a wild time. \u2028\u2028Perfect for groups, couples, and anyone ready for a daring adventure, our truth or dare game guarantees endless fun and laughter!<br><br>With +1300 unique truth or dare challenges, you can dive into a range of categories designed to suit any mood or occasion. Start light with &quot;Party Starter&quot; or &quot;Family Night&quot;, perfect for keeping things friendly and fun. Want something a little crazier? Check out &quot;Insane Party&quot; or spice things up with more daring packs like &quot;Couple&quot;s, &quot;Spice It Up&quot;, &quot;Dirty &amp; Wild&quot;, and much more.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re playing with your closest friends or that special someone, there\u2019s always a spin the bottle challenge that will push the boundaries and create unforgettable memories.<br><br>These are just some of the categories you\u2019ll find:<br>\u25c6 Party Starter<br>\u25c6 Spice It Up<br>\u25c6 Couples<br>\u25c6 Dirty &amp; Wild<br>\u25c6 Insane Party<br><br>Not in the mood for a pre-set category? No problem! You can customize your own challenges, making this the ultimate party game that adapts to your vibe. Use it for a casual night in, as a hilarious group game for gatherings, or as a wild spin the bottle party game to keep the energy going. The best part? You can play at random, just like the classic spin the bottle, or take turns\u2014it&#39;s up to you how you keep the fun flowing!<br><br>Features:<br>\u25c6 Thousands of truth or dare challenges to keep you entertained for hours<br>\u25c6 Multiple party game categories tailored to every type of group, mood, or event<br>\u25c6 Perfect for a classic spin the bottle game with friends, or a fun way to bond